(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/) by GeoNames (https://www.geonames.org/).
The data is provided "as is" without warranty or any representation of accuracy, timeliness or
completeness.

Changes made: only the name, country code, latitude (rounded to 0.1 degree), and population of
each city are kept, and of several cities with the same name in one country only the most
populous. packages/core/scripts/build-cities.ts makes the file from the original.
